  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, until tender, 3-4 mins. In last minute, stir noodles with a fork to separate.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0a0e89c4cafbaaa0401d1-283f10c3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Cut Malaysian tofu into bite-sized chunks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded). Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0a0e89c4cafbaaa0401d1-30776214.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook capsicum, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add Malaysian spice blend, garlic and ginger paste, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the soy sauce, stock powder and water until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and add cooked egg noodles, tofu and baby spinach leaves, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0a0e89c4cafbaaa0401d1-d3338467.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Malaysian-spiced tofu curry between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0a0e89c4cafbaaa0401d1-d2711e40.jpeg"
    }
  ]
